<h2>In this release</h2>
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="info" ac:schema-version="1" ac:macro-id="a2"><ac:rich-text-body><p>This release adds <strong>bulk import</strong> and table sorting to the Widget Manager.</p><p>Role based access control follows in the next release.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro>
<p>Please note: features marked <ac:structured-macro ac:name="status" ac:schema-version="1" ac:macro-id="a3"><ac:parameter ac:name="colour">Yellow</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name="title">PREVIEW</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro> are hidden in the demo system until <time datetime="2026-11-01" />.</p>
<h2>What&rsquo;s new (features)</h2>
<p><strong>CSV import </strong>Users can now import widgets, suppliers and contacts from a CSV file, reducing manual entry during onboarding.</p>
<p><strong>Configurable widget types</strong></p>
<p>Users can define their own widget types. The initial delivery includes:</p>
<ul><li><p>A master list of widget types to create, edit or delete.</p></li><li><p>A default assignment for every category:</p><ul><li><p>Standard widgets</p></li><li><p>Custom widgets</p></li></ul></li></ul>
<p><strong>Table sorting</strong> Users can sort every column in list reports and value help dialogs.</p>
<h2>Bug fixes and improvements</h2>
<h4>Improvements</h4>
<ul><li><p><strong>Homepage update: </strong>The homepage has been streamlined.</p><ul><li><p>New <em>&ldquo;Manage users&rdquo;</em> tile</p></li><li><p>New &ldquo;Import data&rdquo; tile</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>Value help dialog</strong><br />The item counter now shows the number of items that are not selected.</p></li></ul>
